WEBVTT

01:37.430 --> 01:42.880
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.410 --> 01:46.030
[Episode 27]

01:50.509 --> 01:51.509
Chunzhi.

01:54.759 --> 01:55.680
Your bow.

01:56.840 --> 01:58.170
I've wrapped it for you.

02:31.710 --> 02:33.079
Since I married you,

02:33.840 --> 02:34.800
in this life,

02:36.680 --> 02:38.360
I will always be by your side.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.960
The Marquis has just died,

03:19.150 --> 03:20.560
yet as his soldiers,

03:20.800 --> 03:22.660
how dare you massacre the people?

03:23.240 --> 03:24.900
You also came from the people.

03:25.310 --> 03:27.170
You also have family and parents.

03:27.310 --> 03:28.630
Is your courage

03:28.910 --> 03:30.840
all used to slaughter your own kin?

03:52.680 --> 03:53.740
Fellow villagers!

03:54.030 --> 03:55.240
Fight them!

04:05.150 --> 04:05.710
Kill!

04:05.870 --> 04:06.430
Charge!

04:33.800 --> 04:34.480
Stop!

04:34.480 --> 04:35.920
Stop it, all of you!

04:53.920 --> 04:54.800
I, Shen Run,

04:54.800 --> 04:56.600
am here with the Marquis of Danyang.

04:56.600 --> 04:58.000
Who dares to be insolent?

05:10.950 --> 05:11.680
You-

05:44.750 --> 05:45.950
Eunuch Xia.

05:46.360 --> 05:48.360
I heard you served the late Emperor
for decades

05:48.360 --> 05:49.750
without making a single mistake.

05:49.750 --> 05:51.070
How is it that when serving me,

05:51.070 --> 05:53.930
you can't even hold
a bowl of ginseng soup properly?

05:55.920 --> 05:57.000
This old servant

05:57.120 --> 05:58.050
deserves to die!

05:58.270 --> 06:00.270
I have done my best

06:00.270 --> 06:02.250
to serve Your Majesty for years.

06:02.360 --> 06:03.240
From now on,

06:03.480 --> 06:05.420
I will obey your edicts

06:05.560 --> 06:06.870
and never act without your permission.

06:06.870 --> 06:09.560
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

06:11.040 --> 06:13.420
You saw the situation in the court today.

06:13.870 --> 06:16.270
Hundreds of officials have impeached you.

06:16.560 --> 06:19.620
Look at the bunch of people you've
taken under your wing

06:19.800 --> 06:21.930
and the mess they've made of Hengtang.

06:22.270 --> 06:23.330
Peasant uprisings

06:24.390 --> 06:26.480
have been a sign of a nation’s downfall
since ancient times.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.800
If I forgive you,

06:28.240 --> 06:29.770
will the people forgive me?

06:30.390 --> 06:31.390
You better

06:32.240 --> 06:34.240
drink this bowl of soup, Eunuch Xia.

06:40.040 --> 06:41.270
Eunuch Xia.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.610
Commander Shen.

07:24.830 --> 07:26.230
You made such a huge scene

07:26.920 --> 07:28.780
capturing a mere County Sheriff.

07:29.390 --> 07:31.800
But here I am,
the dignified Commissioner Hu,

07:31.800 --> 07:32.750
and you chose

07:33.920 --> 07:35.070
to come along?

07:36.310 --> 07:37.710
You're hurting my pride.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.070
Outside, the public is furious.

07:42.870 --> 07:45.159
In court, the officials
are impeaching you.

07:45.159 --> 07:46.159
Isn't this scene

07:46.600 --> 07:47.680
big enough?

07:48.430 --> 07:49.430
Commissioner Hu,

07:49.680 --> 07:50.920
even at this point,

07:51.630 --> 07:53.240
you are still so greedy.

07:55.390 --> 07:56.390
I admit defeat.

07:59.270 --> 08:00.510
I lost to you.

08:03.120 --> 08:03.720
Come.

08:05.480 --> 08:07.160
Escort me to the capital now.

08:08.830 --> 08:10.630
No need to return to the capital.

08:32.750 --> 08:33.789
Commissioner Hu.

08:36.150 --> 08:37.350
You've been drinking

08:37.390 --> 08:40.120
this aged wine since the time
of the late emperor.

08:41.200 --> 08:42.929
It's time to change your taste.

08:46.320 --> 08:49.320
Try this wine bestowed upon you
by the Emperor.

09:07.270 --> 09:08.870
Brilliant move, Commander.

09:09.840 --> 09:10.670
Impressive.

09:14.120 --> 09:15.850
Since the late emperor's time,

09:16.440 --> 09:18.960
you have relied on Eunuch Xia
as your backer,

09:20.240 --> 09:22.440
leaving chronic problems in Hengtang.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.520
First, officials at all levels

09:24.750 --> 09:25.720
invented various excuses

09:25.720 --> 09:27.380
to increase taxes and corvée,

09:27.480 --> 09:29.080
overwhelming the common people

09:29.080 --> 09:30.720
and causing them to lose their land.

09:30.720 --> 09:33.780
The noble families took the opportunity
to annex land,

09:34.240 --> 09:35.870
expanding their estates.

09:36.270 --> 09:37.530
Once they grew strong,

09:38.030 --> 09:39.830
they began to conceal their land

09:39.910 --> 09:41.240
and pay fewer taxes.

09:42.000 --> 09:44.200
With officials protecting each other,

09:44.840 --> 09:45.960
Hengtang

09:46.670 --> 09:48.270
had long been impenetrable.

09:51.200 --> 09:53.460
My father proposed the Equalization Law

09:54.080 --> 09:56.120
to remeasure land nationwide

09:56.960 --> 09:58.290
and levy taxes by the mu.

09:58.720 --> 10:00.550
Those with more land would pay more,

10:00.550 --> 10:01.620
those with less would pay less,

10:01.620 --> 10:03.270
and those with none would pay nothing.

10:03.270 --> 10:06.730
Taking money from noble families
to relieve disaster victims

10:07.000 --> 10:09.120
and equalizing the burden
of taxes and corvée

10:09.120 --> 10:11.870
would greatly narrow the absurd gap

10:11.870 --> 10:14.150
between the rich and poor in Hengtang.

10:15.670 --> 10:16.270
Yes.

10:17.360 --> 10:19.360
This is indeed a disruptive policy.

10:19.910 --> 10:21.040
But what it disrupts

10:21.550 --> 10:24.750
is the lives of you corrupt officials
and noble families.

10:26.080 --> 10:28.010
But have you ever thought about it?

10:28.200 --> 10:30.130
If taxes and corvée are equalized,

10:30.670 --> 10:32.750
from how many noble families' pockets

10:32.750 --> 10:34.080
will the money be taken?

10:34.600 --> 10:35.660
No matter how much,

10:36.600 --> 10:37.860
they still have to pay.

10:40.390 --> 10:41.850
My father was benevolent.

10:41.870 --> 10:43.270
Though he had a good plan,

10:43.670 --> 10:46.270
he didn't get to enforce it
on any noble family.

10:49.720 --> 10:50.670
Then I'll make

10:50.960 --> 10:52.150
the first strike,

10:53.080 --> 10:55.740
starting right here with you,
Commissioner Hu.

11:05.670 --> 11:08.270
The late Emperor
lacked the resolve to do this.

11:10.120 --> 11:10.960
Will the current Emperor

11:10.960 --> 11:12.110
really do it?

11:12.390 --> 11:13.390
Let me remind you,

11:13.510 --> 11:14.550
we should not

11:14.960 --> 11:16.630
both become bait.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.120
Commissioner Hu.

11:28.550 --> 11:29.670
Once you fall,

11:30.440 --> 11:32.540
the new emperor will see the court's

11:32.630 --> 11:35.030
determination to implement the new policy

11:36.000 --> 11:37.800
and hear the cries of the people.

11:39.150 --> 11:41.410
As long as I accomplish the first strike,

11:42.360 --> 11:44.240
there will naturally be a second

11:45.200 --> 11:46.390
and a third.

11:47.030 --> 11:48.960
Even if the new emperor intends to,

11:50.240 --> 11:52.480
extending it from the capital to Hengtang

11:52.480 --> 11:54.340
will meet with great resistance.

11:54.630 --> 11:56.630
Your father failed to do this.

11:57.270 --> 12:00.320
Do you really think you can?

12:04.390 --> 12:06.850
Commissioner Hu,
you love drinking so much.

12:07.480 --> 12:10.480
Have you ever had the wine
from the Northern Frontier?

12:12.910 --> 12:14.370
In the Northern Frontier,

12:15.240 --> 12:16.900
I only drank two kinds of wine.

12:18.480 --> 12:20.270
One was on cold nights,

12:20.670 --> 12:22.240
to numb the pain

12:22.600 --> 12:23.930
when it was unbearable.

12:24.390 --> 12:25.270
The other

12:26.240 --> 12:28.790
was to see my brothers off when they die

12:29.670 --> 12:31.080
before my eyes in battle.

12:33.510 --> 12:35.150
I often wonder,

12:36.270 --> 12:38.600
when we defend our nations with our lives,

12:39.790 --> 12:41.450
whose homes are we defending?

12:42.320 --> 12:45.630
The homes of you corrupt officials
and noble families

12:45.670 --> 12:46.930
who feed on the people?

12:48.270 --> 12:50.330
Foreign enemies are hard to fend off.

12:50.390 --> 12:51.910
But you parasites

12:52.630 --> 12:54.150
must also be eliminated.

12:56.720 --> 12:58.250
Although my father is dead,

12:58.960 --> 13:02.480
there are fortunately countless people
like him in this world,

13:02.480 --> 13:04.080
helping me in secret

13:04.480 --> 13:07.320
and paving my way
to the new Emperor's side.

13:08.870 --> 13:10.120
My father's ideal...

13:12.150 --> 13:13.320
Our ideal,

13:14.600 --> 13:15.390
is now

13:17.200 --> 13:18.200
almost achieved.

13:21.080 --> 13:22.140
Speaking of which,

13:22.720 --> 13:24.920
I must thank your good brother-in-law.

13:25.600 --> 13:26.670
If it weren't for his help,

13:26.670 --> 13:28.600
it wouldn't have progressed so quickly.

13:28.600 --> 13:30.910
He handed over all the evidence
of the crimes committed

13:30.910 --> 13:32.270
by you and Eunuch Xia.

13:35.320 --> 13:36.450
My brother-in-law,

13:37.080 --> 13:38.270
Xie Shu,

13:38.840 --> 13:40.370
cut off his tail to survive.

13:44.750 --> 13:48.630
You instigated him
to frame my father back then.

13:49.200 --> 13:51.060
Now, he's repeating his old trick

13:51.470 --> 13:54.610
to bring down your Zuixian Tavern.

13:55.480 --> 13:57.150
It is the ending you deserve.

14:00.000 --> 14:01.080
Your father

14:01.630 --> 14:02.830
was indeed innocent.

14:04.150 --> 14:05.750
He was truly incorruptible.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.720
I spent over a month

14:08.720 --> 14:10.910
fabricating many of his crimes,

14:11.790 --> 14:14.120
but the late Emperor didn't believe them.

14:16.000 --> 14:17.200
It was Xie Shu

14:18.240 --> 14:20.030
who personally forged the false evidence

14:20.030 --> 14:22.550
that your father,
as the Jiangnan Transport Commissioner,

14:22.550 --> 14:24.790
profited from canal transport.

14:25.360 --> 14:27.510
This finally angered the late Emperor,

14:27.510 --> 14:30.110
causing the extermination
of the Shen family.

14:31.030 --> 14:32.890
After your Zuixian Tavern falls,

14:33.360 --> 14:34.270
the next

14:34.960 --> 14:36.420
will be the Xie Residence.

14:36.670 --> 14:37.840
I just want to

14:38.600 --> 14:40.000
remind you of something.

14:40.320 --> 14:42.030
Do you really think Xie Shu

14:42.030 --> 14:43.560
turned against your father

14:43.840 --> 14:46.120
just to get a promotion?

14:46.960 --> 14:47.910
Couldn't it be

14:50.960 --> 14:53.910
that your father

14:54.750 --> 14:56.390
knew some

14:56.870 --> 14:59.510
huge secret about Xie Shu?

15:00.480 --> 15:01.670
You mean,

15:03.960 --> 15:05.960
there's another story behind this?

15:06.360 --> 15:08.490
When I was investigating your father,

15:09.750 --> 15:11.350
I accidentally learned that

15:11.510 --> 15:14.240
at the last moment before he went
to the Censorate for interrogation,

15:14.240 --> 15:15.410
he told this matter

15:15.510 --> 15:17.880
to your wife's birth mother,

15:19.080 --> 15:20.440
Jin Chunqing.

15:34.200 --> 15:35.080
Shen.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.750
It's already nice that you're visiting.

15:37.750 --> 15:39.480
Why did you bring so many gifts?

15:39.510 --> 15:40.950
You are too kind.

15:41.150 --> 15:42.360
I was just passing by,

15:42.360 --> 15:44.360
so I brought you some New Year goods.

15:45.870 --> 15:47.150
That day, my father

15:49.080 --> 15:50.510
took me to Yunya's house.

15:52.790 --> 15:53.630
So it was to...

15:56.440 --> 15:57.670
Well,

16:00.440 --> 16:01.790
I've said what I should.

16:09.960 --> 16:11.510
What an exquisite wine cup.

16:12.270 --> 16:13.270
It's a pity

16:15.720 --> 16:16.980
it's containing this.

16:35.720 --> 16:36.720
Commissioner Hu.

16:38.840 --> 16:40.100
Your defeat is sealed.

16:40.630 --> 16:42.290
Looking back on this journey,

16:43.080 --> 16:44.610
have you ever regretted it?

16:49.910 --> 16:51.040
A defeat is a defeat.

16:53.270 --> 16:54.600
What is there to regret?

17:11.880 --> 17:12.680
Qingyuan.

17:12.680 --> 17:14.140
It's rare for you to visit.

17:14.200 --> 17:15.160
Today,

17:15.160 --> 17:17.020
I will show off my skills so you can

17:17.400 --> 17:18.859
have a taste of my cooking.

17:19.550 --> 17:20.349
Have a seat.

17:21.400 --> 17:22.730
I'll be done in a minute.

17:23.240 --> 17:23.880
Coming.

17:23.880 --> 17:24.790
Smells so good.

17:24.920 --> 17:28.250
Are you planning to open a restaurant,
Second Young Master?

17:28.349 --> 17:29.590
Oh, stop calling me that.

17:29.590 --> 17:30.920
Maybe not a restaurant,

17:30.920 --> 17:33.000
but I might open a tavern someday.

17:34.160 --> 17:35.960
But I really didn't expect this.

17:37.910 --> 17:39.610
I'm living a good life now.

17:40.070 --> 17:41.310
Every day, I tend to the farm,

17:41.310 --> 17:42.240
feed the chickens,

17:42.240 --> 17:43.110
have simple meals,

17:43.110 --> 17:44.510
and live a carefree life.

17:44.750 --> 17:46.240
As for matters of the Xie family,

17:46.240 --> 17:47.160
I don't know,

17:47.160 --> 17:48.240
and don't care.

17:48.310 --> 17:49.790
I'm not cut out for it anyway.

17:49.790 --> 17:50.640
Baoxian,

17:51.070 --> 17:52.070
come visit often.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.270
Zhengjun,

17:57.720 --> 17:59.010
I'm hungry.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.440
When will it be ready?

18:01.000 --> 18:02.550
Mother, it's almost done.

18:02.550 --> 18:03.210
It's ready.

18:03.750 --> 18:04.440
Coming.

18:08.590 --> 18:09.480
Come on.

18:10.000 --> 18:10.480
Here.

18:18.070 --> 18:18.590
Come.

18:20.000 --> 18:21.000
Let's eat.

18:21.000 --> 18:21.480
Here.

18:22.160 --> 18:23.090
Here, Qingyuan.

18:24.510 --> 18:25.480
Qingyuan.

18:25.480 --> 18:26.680
I'm so happy

18:26.880 --> 18:28.400
that you could come today.

18:31.400 --> 18:32.070
Mother.

18:32.310 --> 18:32.960
Mother,

18:33.720 --> 18:34.720
let's eat.

18:34.880 --> 18:35.480
Eat.

18:36.160 --> 18:37.920
Is Zhenglun still studying?

18:38.550 --> 18:39.080
Zheng...

18:39.110 --> 18:39.910
Call him over.

18:43.310 --> 18:44.030
Zhenglun!

18:44.240 --> 18:44.880
Brother.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.280
-Zhenglun, come and eat.
-Come out and eat.

18:47.830 --> 18:49.760
Look at you, you're always so slow.

18:50.160 --> 18:51.350
Mother was calling you.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.160
Hurry.

18:52.270 --> 18:53.240
-Sit down.
-Sit down.

18:53.240 --> 18:54.030
Sit down.

18:55.830 --> 18:56.590
Lun.

18:56.810 --> 18:58.200
-Studying is hard work.
-Let’s eat.

18:58.200 --> 18:59.750
Don't exhaust yourself.

19:00.160 --> 19:01.000
Come.

19:01.200 --> 19:01.830
Eat.

19:01.830 --> 19:02.270
Mother.

19:02.270 --> 19:02.830
Here.

19:02.830 --> 19:05.230
I stir-fried cabbage for you again.
Try it.

19:08.550 --> 19:09.960
Come, try this too.

19:10.480 --> 19:11.400
Come, try it.

19:13.640 --> 19:14.350
This is also delicious.

19:14.350 --> 19:14.880
How is it?

19:16.200 --> 19:17.000
Second Madam,

19:18.030 --> 19:19.740
I came today to ask you

19:20.030 --> 19:21.160
if there's someone

19:21.720 --> 19:23.850
named Lu Lingshu in the Xie Residence.

19:41.270 --> 19:42.000
Mother.

19:43.030 --> 19:43.640
Mother?

19:45.480 --> 19:46.410
It's delicious.

19:46.880 --> 19:47.760
Is it?

19:49.000 --> 19:49.720
Mother,

19:50.070 --> 19:51.000
do you know

19:51.110 --> 19:52.550
who Lu Lingshu is?

19:55.590 --> 19:56.550
Lu Lingshu.

20:00.960 --> 20:01.790
Lu Lingshu.

20:06.480 --> 20:07.550
Lu Lingshu.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.000
Aren't you Lu Lingshu?

20:16.920 --> 20:17.480
Tell me.

20:17.480 --> 20:18.750
Your Lordship!

20:18.750 --> 20:20.110
I am not from the Xia's faction.

20:20.110 --> 20:22.200
Hu Xing forced me to do everything.

20:22.440 --> 20:23.880
Please believe me, Your Lordship!

20:23.880 --> 20:24.830
Spare me!

20:24.830 --> 20:27.680
I'm innocent!

20:27.960 --> 20:29.110
Coward.

20:34.640 --> 20:36.240
Congratulations, Commander.

20:36.240 --> 20:37.680
After 10 years of hiding,

20:37.920 --> 20:39.780
you finally avenged your father.

20:39.830 --> 20:42.630
What a great trick to escape
and deceive everyone.

20:43.550 --> 20:44.550
For this round,

20:45.160 --> 20:46.510
I admit my defeat.

20:50.640 --> 20:52.550
Do you know what it's like
to love someone,

20:52.550 --> 20:53.200
Shen Run?

20:53.960 --> 20:55.750
It is wanting to make love with him,

20:55.750 --> 20:58.150
and share the beauty
of this world with him.

20:59.030 --> 21:00.560
It's wanting to be with him,

21:00.790 --> 21:02.320
wearing flowers in spring,

21:02.550 --> 21:04.010
boating on summer nights,

21:04.400 --> 21:05.800
climbing high in autumn,

21:06.070 --> 21:08.270
and warming wine by the stove in winter.

21:08.960 --> 21:12.220
You're two blocks of wood
with only revenge in your hearts;

21:12.350 --> 21:14.750
what's left in your hearts besides hatred?

21:17.160 --> 21:18.360
I have already heard.

21:19.640 --> 21:22.680
Hu Xing's remaining followers
have all been sentenced to death.

21:22.680 --> 21:24.140
Did you come here this time

21:25.000 --> 21:26.680
to see me off one last time?

21:37.550 --> 21:39.610
[Memorial]

21:46.000 --> 21:47.200
My dear Yuting

21:48.000 --> 21:50.530
loves this kind
of exquisite vessel the most.

21:53.030 --> 21:54.720
What an exquisite wine cup.

21:55.510 --> 21:56.350
What a pity.

21:57.270 --> 21:58.800
I will never have the chance

21:59.720 --> 22:00.750
to gift her some

22:01.790 --> 22:02.720
fun,

22:03.400 --> 22:04.800
exquisite things again.

22:09.880 --> 22:10.750
Fortunately,

22:14.350 --> 22:16.080
I've wiped away all the matters

22:16.200 --> 22:17.480
she handled.

22:17.880 --> 22:18.240
[The funds amassed over the years were
my sole doing; no others were involved.]

22:18.270 --> 22:18.960
[Pei Yuting, Princess of Yongjia,
is usually upright and prudent.]

22:18.990 --> 22:19.670
[Her actions resulted from my threat,
not from her own volition.]

22:20.880 --> 22:22.070
I will take on

22:22.720 --> 22:24.030
all the blame.

22:26.000 --> 22:27.060
She is still young.

22:31.070 --> 22:32.670
She still has plenty of time.

22:36.920 --> 22:38.880
He said all of his actions

22:39.270 --> 22:40.730
had nothing to do with you.

22:41.270 --> 22:42.270
So His Majesty

22:42.680 --> 22:45.140
ordered me to escort you
back to the capital.

22:46.830 --> 22:48.200
This old man...

23:01.720 --> 23:03.780
Mother, you haven't been out lately.

23:03.830 --> 23:05.400
Are you feeling any better?

23:06.510 --> 23:07.590
I feel better.

23:11.350 --> 23:13.000
I called you here today

23:14.720 --> 23:16.780
because I have something to tell you.

23:17.790 --> 23:19.190
Please go ahead, Mother.

23:20.550 --> 23:22.480
I have agreed with your father

23:23.110 --> 23:24.880
that on a sunny day,

23:26.880 --> 23:29.940
we will send you to the capital
to visit your relatives.

23:30.200 --> 23:31.330
Visit my relatives?

23:32.430 --> 23:33.520
Your birth mother

23:35.480 --> 23:36.880
still has some relatives

23:37.510 --> 23:38.920
in the capital.

23:39.830 --> 23:40.830
The Xia family

23:41.790 --> 23:43.270
can still more or less

23:44.550 --> 23:46.310
take good care of you.

23:48.790 --> 23:50.320
You are still sick, Mother.

23:52.000 --> 23:53.240
How can I leave?

23:54.400 --> 23:56.310
It's exactly because I'm sick

23:59.070 --> 24:01.070
that we can't delay this any longer.

24:04.480 --> 24:06.830
I must make plans for you ahead of time.

24:10.110 --> 24:12.030
Qingru is already married.

24:16.000 --> 24:17.960
The only one I'm worried about

24:20.440 --> 24:22.000
is you.

24:26.350 --> 24:28.160
Back then,

24:29.960 --> 24:32.690
I even wanted to marry you
into the Pei residence.

24:33.310 --> 24:34.570
Who would have thought

24:35.720 --> 24:38.200
that Qinghe would beat you to it?

24:42.000 --> 24:44.960
I even hated the third branch
for quite a while.

24:47.550 --> 24:48.480
Mother,

24:49.510 --> 24:51.240
Pei Guanling and Eldest Sister

24:52.110 --> 24:53.640
were mutually in love.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.560
Mother, you should be...

24:56.750 --> 24:57.680
happy for me

24:58.960 --> 25:00.790
that I didn't marry him.

25:01.550 --> 25:03.880
About that Mr. Zhou you like...

25:07.000 --> 25:07.920
I...

25:10.000 --> 25:11.920
actually asked around about him.

25:15.310 --> 25:17.550
He was devoted to you,

25:19.160 --> 25:20.640
studied hard,

25:21.960 --> 25:23.510
and was a good match.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.310
Qingrong.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.480
Don't be sad.

25:34.000 --> 25:35.510
In your life,

25:37.590 --> 25:40.110
you won't just meet Mr. Zhou.

25:41.270 --> 25:42.800
When you get to the capital,

25:43.590 --> 25:46.240
You will meet so many people.

25:49.480 --> 25:51.200
But you must remember this.

25:54.000 --> 25:55.960
Background is not important.

25:56.640 --> 25:58.100
Neither is family status.

25:58.160 --> 25:59.640
None of that matters.

26:01.110 --> 26:02.510
You must find someone

26:03.830 --> 26:06.240
who leaves you with no regrets
in this life.

26:09.270 --> 26:10.510
You are smart

26:11.440 --> 26:12.500
and clear-headed.

26:13.790 --> 26:16.200
You've always known what you want.

26:17.160 --> 26:19.240
You definitely won't be like me.

26:20.070 --> 26:22.200
You will live a good life.

26:28.440 --> 26:29.270
Mother...

26:30.270 --> 26:31.590
Remember.

26:33.480 --> 26:35.010
When you get to the capital,

26:36.440 --> 26:39.110
you are just Xia Yingying's daughter.

26:40.310 --> 26:41.720
You have nothing to do

26:42.960 --> 26:44.020
with the Xie family

26:45.000 --> 26:46.680
or me.

26:48.720 --> 26:50.200
From now on,

26:54.750 --> 26:56.440
you must live anew.

26:59.030 --> 27:00.480
You must absolutely

27:01.830 --> 27:03.240
not return to Hengtang.

27:06.200 --> 27:07.550
And there is no need

27:09.920 --> 27:11.400
to worry about me.

27:14.830 --> 27:15.640
Mother.

27:21.240 --> 27:23.170
Mother, you are still gravely ill.

27:23.750 --> 27:24.880
How could I possibly

27:25.350 --> 27:26.960
abandon you?

27:28.790 --> 27:29.960
For so many years,

27:31.270 --> 27:33.200
you raised me.

27:35.480 --> 27:36.680
In my heart,

27:39.440 --> 27:41.350
you are my real mother.

27:42.920 --> 27:44.070
I know...

27:47.000 --> 27:48.480
I know...

28:01.000 --> 28:02.000
It's fine.

28:03.680 --> 28:06.080
I will be better
after taking the medicine.

28:10.750 --> 28:12.000
It's okay.

28:13.830 --> 28:14.760
Don't be afraid.

28:16.880 --> 28:18.310
It's just a spill.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.270
You can brew another one for me.

28:27.440 --> 28:30.030
I want to drink the medicine you brew.

28:33.550 --> 28:34.400
Hurry,

28:36.590 --> 28:37.590
go.

28:39.310 --> 28:40.270
Go.

28:51.480 --> 28:52.510
Go...

29:18.480 --> 29:19.330
Your father

29:19.360 --> 29:21.350
loved your birth mother so much back then.

29:21.350 --> 29:23.640
Even if she committed a grave crime,

29:23.720 --> 29:24.950
he would never

29:25.030 --> 29:27.270
have had the heart to lay a finger on her.

29:28.550 --> 29:29.510
So why

29:30.070 --> 29:31.310
did he agree to let your birth mother

29:31.310 --> 29:33.400
ask to leave the residence,

29:33.400 --> 29:35.270
then not look for her for 9 years,

29:35.270 --> 29:37.550
only to kill her as soon as he found her?

29:38.070 --> 29:39.960
Everything that happened
to your birth mother,

29:39.960 --> 29:41.160
including her death,

29:41.510 --> 29:43.240
is due to Xie Shu's

29:43.510 --> 29:46.070
unspeakable secret.

29:58.110 --> 29:58.880
Madam.

30:00.720 --> 30:01.590
Madam.

30:03.830 --> 30:05.440
Fourth Lady wants to see you.

30:06.510 --> 30:07.750
I stopped her.

30:11.000 --> 30:13.160
It's time to put an end to this.

30:14.510 --> 30:17.030
Tell her to wait for me in the main hall.

30:18.640 --> 30:20.750
I will go see her.

30:21.510 --> 30:22.270
Yes.

30:36.590 --> 30:37.830
Long time no see.

30:39.310 --> 30:40.200
I'm here.

30:41.750 --> 30:42.750
What do you want?

30:44.240 --> 30:45.830
Can you tell me now

30:46.920 --> 30:48.350
who Lu Lingshu is?

30:50.400 --> 30:52.480
You are indeed smart and capable.

30:53.920 --> 30:55.050
You have discovered

30:56.830 --> 30:58.630
the secret of the bronze mirror.

31:01.310 --> 31:02.640
But what does Lu Lingshu

31:04.510 --> 31:06.480
have to do with you avenging

31:06.680 --> 31:07.920
your mother?

31:08.750 --> 31:10.810
Didn't you want to kill Xie Shu?

31:11.240 --> 31:12.590
Why didn't you kill him?

31:15.400 --> 31:16.680
My brother is dead.

31:17.920 --> 31:19.170
The Hu family is gone.

31:19.270 --> 31:20.790
But Xie Shu is still alive.

31:21.270 --> 31:23.200
What does knowing who Lu Lingshu is

31:23.270 --> 31:24.850
have to do with killing him?

31:30.440 --> 31:31.240
Xie Shu?

31:32.400 --> 31:33.730
Of course I can kill him.

31:36.270 --> 31:38.070
But I want to figure out

31:39.590 --> 31:41.030
why my birth mother died.

31:47.000 --> 31:49.790
Is there anything in this world
that can be figured out

31:49.790 --> 31:51.120
and explained clearly?

31:51.750 --> 31:53.200
I’ve lived my whole life,

31:53.200 --> 31:54.600
yet I haven't figured out

31:56.400 --> 31:57.550
what love is.

32:00.350 --> 32:01.440
I thought that

32:03.310 --> 32:04.920
since I married Xie Shu,

32:05.730 --> 32:07.930
as long as I treated him wholeheartedly

32:08.960 --> 32:09.880
and loved him,

32:10.960 --> 32:13.220
he would definitely fall in love with me.

32:19.110 --> 32:21.570
But I've only seen Xie Shu
look at your mother

32:24.110 --> 32:26.920
the way Shen Run looks at you.

32:30.200 --> 32:31.590
In his eyes,

32:33.350 --> 32:34.720
I am nothing.

32:36.160 --> 32:37.600
Xia Yingying,

32:38.310 --> 32:39.480
Mei Yinghua, and I.

32:40.030 --> 32:41.440
in Xie Shu's eyes,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.550
we were merely power,

32:45.000 --> 32:46.160
beauty,

32:47.160 --> 32:48.160
and money.

32:48.960 --> 32:50.060
We were just

32:50.640 --> 32:52.840
stepping stones for Xie Shu to climb up.

32:55.480 --> 32:57.540
But your birth mother was different.

32:59.160 --> 33:00.680
She was nothing.

33:02.720 --> 33:04.070
Yet Xie Shu loved her.

33:06.200 --> 33:08.030
He loved her with all his heart.

33:12.750 --> 33:13.720
I hated her.

33:15.310 --> 33:16.590
We all hated her.

33:18.350 --> 33:19.550
We hated her to death.

33:22.070 --> 33:22.920
So,

33:24.440 --> 33:27.700
forcing your birth mother out of
the Xie Residence that day

33:35.920 --> 33:38.480
was an unspoken decision shared among us.

33:43.070 --> 33:44.830
You are still too young.

33:46.750 --> 33:48.680
You don't understand what love is.

33:51.590 --> 33:52.920
The word "love"

33:54.640 --> 33:56.240
is sought after by everyone.

33:57.960 --> 33:59.760
But when survival is concerned,

34:01.000 --> 34:02.600
it is abandoned by everyone.

34:07.790 --> 34:08.710
Mother.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.860
You're truly a noble of the Hu family.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.670
Even this sick,

34:14.150 --> 34:16.280
you are still so elegant and graceful.

34:16.840 --> 34:17.800
Nine years ago,

34:18.699 --> 34:21.159
you came to my house wearing
that accessory.

34:21.360 --> 34:23.110
At that time, I just thought

34:23.480 --> 34:24.480
that this hairpin

34:24.880 --> 34:26.110
looked stunning

34:26.550 --> 34:28.060
under the sun.

34:28.670 --> 34:29.630
I also thought

34:30.230 --> 34:32.310
the woman wearing this hairpin

34:32.400 --> 34:33.929
was elegant

34:34.070 --> 34:35.510
and extraordinary.

34:36.480 --> 34:37.150
That day,

34:38.440 --> 34:40.840
what exactly did you say
to my birth mother?

34:41.710 --> 34:42.840
What does Lu Lingshu

34:43.230 --> 34:45.110
have to do with my birth mother's death?

34:45.110 --> 34:47.170
What exactly is that massive secret?

34:53.150 --> 34:56.960
I've been your mother for a while now.

34:58.150 --> 35:00.440
I should tell you something useful.

35:04.670 --> 35:05.670
Xie Shu...

35:07.860 --> 35:09.750
Is just an imposter.

35:13.210 --> 35:16.000
Everything in the Xie Residence is fake!

35:22.800 --> 35:24.630
You actually want to see me.

35:26.150 --> 35:27.320
Then speak.

35:28.360 --> 35:29.510
What is the matter?

35:32.710 --> 35:33.920
The day before yesterday,

35:33.920 --> 35:36.030
before Shen Zhibai was summoned
by the Censorate,

35:36.030 --> 35:37.150
he came to see me.

35:38.000 --> 35:38.840
At that time,

35:39.110 --> 35:40.370
he looked conflicted.

35:41.150 --> 35:42.960
I asked him what had happened,

35:43.030 --> 35:44.490
but he hesitated to speak.

35:45.070 --> 35:46.400
Right before he left,

35:47.070 --> 35:48.190
he finally told me.

35:52.960 --> 35:53.760
Chunqing.

35:55.280 --> 35:57.800
I've kept something from you
for over 10 years.

35:57.800 --> 35:59.930
I don't know if I helped you back then

36:00.230 --> 36:01.490
or harmed you.

36:03.760 --> 36:05.020
More than10 years ago,

36:05.550 --> 36:06.590
it was Xie Shu

36:07.150 --> 36:09.000
who personally killed

36:09.920 --> 36:10.920
his father.

36:15.920 --> 36:17.850
I couldn't figure it out back then.

36:18.960 --> 36:21.490
Xie Shu was just born days before

36:21.550 --> 36:23.100
Old Master Xie's death.

36:23.510 --> 36:25.510
How could he have killed his father?

36:26.230 --> 36:27.800
Then I realized

36:28.800 --> 36:30.190
the only possibility.

36:34.190 --> 36:36.110
You actually guessed it.

36:41.280 --> 36:43.800
You knew Xie Shu killed your birth mother.

36:44.190 --> 36:45.520
Why didn't you kill him?

36:47.000 --> 36:48.270
Are you scared?

36:48.840 --> 36:51.400
Are you scared because
you've never killed anyone?

36:51.400 --> 36:53.880
Are you afraid of the feeling

36:54.920 --> 36:57.810
of a life slipping through your fingers?

37:10.390 --> 37:12.790
[Qinyue Corridor]

37:16.920 --> 37:19.120
Fifth Concubine, what brings you here?

37:23.510 --> 37:25.400
[Qinyue Corridor]

37:25.760 --> 37:27.510
You lowly performer,

37:28.030 --> 37:31.230
do you really think
you're fit to live in Danyue Pavilion?

37:35.190 --> 37:37.400
The courtyard
was arranged by the Old Madam.

37:37.400 --> 37:38.760
-If you have any complaints,
-Chunqing.

37:38.760 --> 37:39.480
you can...

37:39.840 --> 37:40.480
Shut up!

37:42.480 --> 37:43.670
What are you doing?

37:43.670 --> 37:44.530
Concubine Xia!

37:46.110 --> 37:46.970
Let me tell you,

37:47.400 --> 37:49.430
I'll give you 3 days to move out.

37:52.400 --> 37:53.480
That day,

37:54.150 --> 37:56.000
I finally found a chance

37:57.760 --> 38:00.050
to not only eliminate two threats,

38:00.960 --> 38:02.760
but also use this secret

38:02.760 --> 38:04.440
to threaten Xie Shu.

38:09.480 --> 38:12.140
I know you hate Xia Yingying
to the core, My Lord.

38:16.510 --> 38:19.440
But you can't make a move
because of her great-uncle.

38:21.110 --> 38:22.170
It doesn't matter.

38:22.590 --> 38:23.500
I...

38:24.150 --> 38:25.670
am willing to be of help.

38:34.510 --> 38:35.400
Fifth Madam,

38:35.550 --> 38:38.190
Fourth Madam told me to bring you
this pregnancy tonic.

38:38.190 --> 38:40.030
She also said she would

38:40.030 --> 38:42.890
-move out of Danyue Pavilion soon.
-Leave it there.

39:55.590 --> 39:56.360
Let go!

39:56.550 --> 39:57.800
Let go of me!

39:58.150 --> 39:59.670
Let go of me!

39:59.670 --> 40:01.300
-Why did you hurt me?
-It’s not me!

40:01.300 --> 40:02.190
Let go!

40:02.190 --> 40:03.230
I'll kill you!

40:24.510 --> 40:26.180
It wasn't me.

40:31.070 --> 40:32.090
It wasn't me!

40:43.070 --> 40:44.030
Qingrong.

41:12.550 --> 41:13.590
That day,

41:16.190 --> 41:18.110
I was going to strangle her.

41:26.360 --> 41:27.760
But I just couldn't do it.

41:39.070 --> 41:40.030
Somebody, help!

41:40.030 --> 41:41.110
Someone is dead!

41:42.670 --> 41:43.270
Qingrong.

41:44.190 --> 41:46.590
Shall we have some tangyuan soup together?

41:46.760 --> 41:47.890
Good girl, let's go.

41:53.590 --> 41:55.320
Thank goodness, I didn't do it.

41:57.920 --> 42:00.230
That's how Qingrong became my daughter.

42:04.480 --> 42:08.320
I burned Soul-Suppressing Mantras
every day

42:09.140 --> 42:11.690
just to suppress Xia Yingying's soul.

42:12.480 --> 42:14.140
I didn't want her to come back.

42:14.550 --> 42:15.230
I didn't want her to come back

42:15.230 --> 42:16.210
and tell my daughter

42:16.210 --> 42:17.960
what I did to her mother

42:17.960 --> 42:19.680
and the harm I caused her!

42:19.840 --> 42:21.970
So you not only killed my mother,

42:22.110 --> 42:23.480
but also almost killed me too!
